The '''ISB conference room'''<ref name="Aldhani EG" /> was a room in the [[ISB Central Office]] on [[Coruscant]]. It was used for<ref name="Aldhani" /> [[Investigations]] branch<ref name="Dawn Visual">''[[Star Wars: Dawn of Rebellion: The Visual Guide]]''</ref> officer meetings, including the sector supervisors' forum<ref name="Aldhani" /> and major policy change announcements.<ref name="Announcement">{{Andor|Announcement}}</ref>

==Description==
The ISB conference room was a circular chamber inside the ISB central office. It featured a large circular table with seating and [[holopad]] screens for sixteen [[officer]]s and a meeting coordinator. A large [[Imperial crest]] was prominently featured behind the meeting coordinator's seat, and the white walls were decorated with a textured cover.<ref name="Aldhani" />

==History==
In [[5 BBY]],<ref name="Date">"[[Aldhani (episode)|Aldhani]]" takes place shortly after "[[Kassa (episode)|Kassa]]," which takes place in [[5 BBY]].</ref> [[Major]] [[Lio Partagaz|Partagaz]] used this chamber to conduct the sector supervisors' forum, where major security incidents and threats from each supervisor's [[sector]] could be identified and solutions could be proposed.<ref name="Aldhani" /> Partagaz also encouraged the use of the forum as a space where disagreements between forum members would be discussed and solutions could be found without causing interpersonal aggressions. If need be, a supervisor could be reassigned to a different sector as a result of these discussions.<ref name="Announcement" />

[[File:ISBFullMeeting-Andor4.png|thumb|300px|right|Major Partagaz leads an Imperial Security Bureau meeting]]
Following the [[Ferrix]] [[Ambush on Ferrix|incident]], Supervisor [[Blevin]] reported the disaster to the forum and was instructed to investigate, annexing the [[Consolidated Holdings of Preox-Morlana Corporation|Preox-Morlana]] sector to the [[Galactic Empire]].<ref name="Aldhani" /> Similarly, after the [[Aldhani heist|heist]] on the [[Aldhani dam]], Colonel [[Wullf Yularen|Yularen]] reported the implementation of the [[Public Order Resentencing Directive]] to the supervisors' forum, making a speech regarding the Bureau's intention to strengthen Imperial security around all sectors.<ref name="Announcement" />

Following [[Syril Karn]]'s persistent reports regarding Cassian Andor and the subsequent discovery of his involvement in the Aldhani heist by supervisor Meero, a board of officers including Colonel Yularen was again assembled in the chamber. There, the Colonel was presented with the recovered [[Imperial N-S9 Starpath Unit|Starpath]] unit from [[Ferrix]] and briefed on the intelligence collected on Andor and his rebel connection, the [[Luthen Rael|Axis]].<ref name="Narkina 5 (episode)">{{Andor|Narkina 5 (episode)}}</ref>

